{
  "coreId": "mesen",
  "format": "libretro-core-options-v2",
  "groups": [
    {
      "description": {
        "en": "Change overclocking, region, RAM and FDS settings.",
        "zh-Hans": "超频、地区、RAM 与 FDS 设置。"
      },
      "id": "system",
      "options": [
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "None",
          "description": {
            "en": "Use this to overclock or underclock the CPU. NOTE: Overclocking can cause issues in some games.",
            "zh-Hans": "提高或降低模拟 CPU 的速度。注意：超频可能导致部分游戏出现问题。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_overclock",
          "restartRequired": false,
          "title": {
            "en": "Overclock",
            "zh-Hans": "CPU 超频"
          },
          "type": "select",
          "valueLabels": {
            "High": {
              "en": "High",
              "zh-Hans": "高"
            },
            "Low": {
              "en": "Low",
              "zh-Hans": "低"
            },
            "Medium": {
              "en": "Medium",
              "zh-Hans": "中"
            },
            "None": {
              "en": "Off",
              "zh-Hans": "关"
            },
            "Very High": {
              "en": "Very High",
              "zh-Hans": "极高"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "None",
            "Low",
            "Medium",
            "High",
            "Very High"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "Before NMI (Recommended)",
          "description": {
            "en": "Increases the number of scanlines in the PPU, before or after the NMI signal is triggered at the end of the visible frame. This effectively gives more time for games to perform calculations, which can reduce slowdowns in games. 'Before NMI' is the preferred option for overclocking, 'After NMI' should only be used if it does not work as expected.",
            "zh-Hans": "在可见画面结束、NMI 信号触发之前或之后增加额外的扫描线，让游戏有更多时间运算，从而减少卡顿。优先使用「NMI 前」，效果不理想时再尝试「NMI 后」。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_overclock_type",
          "restartRequired": false,
          "title": {
            "en": "Overclock Type",
            "zh-Hans": "超频方式"
          },
          "type": "select",
          "valueLabels": {
            "After NMI": {
              "en": "After NMI",
              "zh-Hans": "NMI 后"
            },
            "Before NMI (Recommended)": {
              "en": "Before NMI (Recommended)",
              "zh-Hans": "NMI 前（推荐）"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "Before NMI (Recommended)",
            "After NMI"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "Auto",
          "description": {
            "en": "When set to Auto, the emulator will try to detect the game's region (NTSC or PAL), however this is not always possible. When there is nothing to suggest a game is for the PAL region, the NTSC region will be used by default. Dendy is used to mimic a number of different NES clones, in particular, the Dendy, which was a popular clone in Russia.",
            "zh-Hans": "「自动」会尝试识别游戏是 NTSC 还是 PAL 版本，无法识别时使用 NTSC。Dendy 模拟俄罗斯等地流行的 Dendy 兼容机。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_region",
          "restartRequired": true,
          "title": {
            "en": "Region",
            "zh-Hans": "地区"
          },
          "type": "select",
          "valueLabels": {
            "Auto": {
              "en": "Auto",
              "zh-Hans": "自动"
            },
            "Dendy": {
              "en": "Dendy",
              "zh-Hans": "Dendy"
            },
            "NTSC": {
              "en": "NTSC",
              "zh-Hans": "NTSC"
            },
            "PAL": {
              "en": "PAL",
              "zh-Hans": "PAL"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "Auto",
            "NTSC",
            "PAL",
            "Dendy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "All 0s (Default)",
          "description": {
            "en": "On a console, the RAM's state at power on is undetermined and relatively random. This option lets you select Mesen's behavior when initializing RAM: set all bits to 0, set all bits to 1, or randomize the value of each bit.",
            "zh-Hans": "真实主机开机时 RAM 的内容不确定。可选择全部置 0、全部置 1 或随机填充。部分游戏会用 RAM 初始值生成随机数等。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_ramstate",
          "restartRequired": true,
          "title": {
            "en": "RAM Power-On State",
            "zh-Hans": "开机 RAM 初始值"
          },
          "type": "select",
          "valueLabels": {
            "All 0s (Default)": {
              "en": "All 0s (Default)",
              "zh-Hans": "全 0（默认）"
            },
            "All 1s": {
              "en": "All 1s",
              "zh-Hans": "全 1"
            },
            "Random Values": {
              "en": "Random Values",
              "zh-Hans": "随机"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "All 0s (Default)",
            "All 1s",
            "Random Values"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "disabled",
          "description": {
            "en": "By default, the FDS boots with no disk inserted in the drive. This option makes it so the player does not need to manually insert disk 1, side A manually.",
            "zh-Hans": "FDS 默认开机时驱动器中没有磁盘。开启后会自动插入第 1 张磁盘的 A 面，无需手动操作。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_fdsautoinsertdisk",
          "restartRequired": true,
          "title": {
            "en": "FDS: Automatically Insert Disk",
            "zh-Hans": "FDS 自动插入磁盘"
          },
          "type": "bool",
          "valueLabels": {
            "disabled": {
              "en": "OFF",
              "zh-Hans": "关"
            },
            "enabled": {
              "en": "ON",
              "zh-Hans": "开"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "disabled",
            "enabled"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "system",
          "defaultValue": "disabled",
          "description": {
            "en": "FDS games contain a large number of load screens due to their data being stored on floppy drives. Mesen needs to emulate this floppy drive's speed to ensure accurate emulation. This option makes it so Mesen runs the emulation as fast as it can when a game is loading data from the disk, which greatly reduces the time spent on loading screens.",
            "zh-Hans": "FDS 游戏存放在磁盘上，读盘画面很多。开启后读盘期间全速运行，大幅缩短等待时间。"
          },
          "key": "mesen_fdsfastforwardload",
          "restartRequired": false,
          "title": {
            "en": "FDS: Fast Forward While Loading",
            "zh-Hans": "FDS 读盘时加速"
          },
          "type": "bool",
          "valueLabels": {
            "disabled": {
              "en": "OFF",
              "zh-Hans": "关"
            },
            "enabled": {
              "en": "ON",
              "zh-Hans": "开"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "disabled",
            "enabled"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title": {
        "en": "System",
        "zh-Hans": "系统"
      }
    },
